### Example requests for every endpoint.
### VS Code: "REST Client" extension; JetBrains IDEs: built in. Click "Send Request".
### Set apiKey to the API_KEY in your .env. Requests further down reuse ids
### from earlier responses (run them top to bottom).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = CHANGE_ME_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_KEY

### Health (no key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Any other request without the key → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/records

### Import records: created / invalid / duplicate / conflict
# @name createImport
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    { "externalId": "e-1", "source": "partner-a", "title": "Football tournament", "description": "Open to all ages", "date": "2026-07-01" },
    { "externalId": "e-2", "source": "partner-a", "title": "Community picnic", "description": "Bring your own food", "date": "2026-07-05T10:00:00+02:00" },
    { "externalId": "e-3", "source": "partner-b", "title": "Modern art exhibition", "description": "At the city museum", "date": "2026-07-10" },
    { "externalId": "e-4", "source": "partner-b", "title": "", "description": "Missing title, impossible date", "date": "2026-02-30" },
    { "externalId": "e-1", "source": "partner-a", "title": "Football tournament", "description": "Open to all ages", "date": "2026-07-01" },
    { "externalId": "e-3", "source": "partner-b", "title": "Changed title", "description": "At the city museum", "date": "2026-07-10" }
  ]
}

@importId = {{createImport.response.body.importId}}
@recordId = {{createImport.response.body.items[0].recordId}}
@reviewRecordId = {{createImport.response.body.items[1].recordId}}

### Import progress (classification runs in the background)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Per-record feedback: only the invalid ones
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importId}}/items?outcome=invalid
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Per-record feedback: paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importId}}/items?limit=2&offset=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Search records: all filters are optional and combine
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?source=partner-a&from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-31&q=football&limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Records by category / status
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?category=sports&status=classified
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### One record with its classification history
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/{{recordId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Review queue (longest waiting first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Correct a classification ("Community picnic" → other, needs review)
POST {{baseUrl}}/records/{{reviewRecordId}}/corrections
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "culture", "reason": "A community event" }

### The record now: correction is current, the original stays in history
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/{{reviewRecordId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Retry one failed record (409 if it isn't failed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/records/{{recordId}}/retry
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Retry every failed record of the import
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importId}}/retry
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Error: invalid batch → 400 invalid_batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "records": [] }

### Error: unknown category in a correction → 400 invalid_body
POST {{baseUrl}}/records/{{recordId}}/corrections
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "music", "reason": "r" }

### Error: bad filter → 400 invalid_query
GET {{baseUrl}}/records?status=done
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
